su name begin as wo speaker identity be ceremony def
  su name result be speaker identity as wo begin do
  su name result ret
prah

su name stop as wo speaker identity be ceremony def
  su name result be speaker identity as wo stop do
  su name result ret
prah

su name discharge as wo speaker identity be ceremony def
  su name result be speaker identity as wo discharge do
  su name result ret
prah

su name identify fromstate wo audio from filename source to name text speaker be ceremony def
  su name result fromstate wo audio from filename of from of this be speaker identity do
  su name result ret
prah

su name identify fromstate wo audio from filename source ob text speaker label to name text speaker be ceremony def
  su name result fromstate wo audio from filename of from of this ob text of ob of this be speaker identity do
  su name result ret
prah

su name identify fromstate wo audio from filename source with name map options to name text speaker be ceremony def
  su name result fromstate wo audio from filename of from of this with name of with of this be speaker identity do
  su name result ret
prah

su name identify fromstate wo audio from filename source ob text speaker label with name map options to name text speaker be ceremony def
  su name result fromstate wo audio from filename of from of this ob text of ob of this with name of with of this be speaker identity do
  su name result ret
prah

su name rename speaker from text speaker old to text speaker new be ceremony def
  su name rename speaker stage from text of from of this to text of to of this be speaker identity do
  su name result ob text of ob of rename speaker stage be text do
  su name result ret
prah

exists su name identify be export ya
exists su name rename speaker be export ya
